WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.856
Agents often spend tokens looking for what already exists.

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:07.722
The find call is one short search across the shared library.

00:00:08.037 --> 00:00:11.496
Here it finds a kit and a seed pack for a grant renewal.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:14.497
This answer is about 1,000 bytes.

00:00:14.742 --> 00:00:19.083
The older search, for the same words, returns about 21,000.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:24.430
We measured this on November 4, on 204 held-out search questions,

00:00:24.466 --> 00:00:27.635
from our own library and from real agent queries.

00:00:27.949 --> 00:00:31.385
The right item came first 78 percent of the time,

00:00:31.525 --> 00:00:34.241
against 33 percent for the older search.

00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:39.953
Replies used about 157 tokens, against about 2,950.

00:00:40.198 --> 00:00:41.544
Tokens are an estimate.

00:00:41.556 --> 00:00:44.737
The questions favor us, because they come from our own rows.

00:00:45.121 --> 00:00:49.648
On real agent queries alone, it was 88 percent against 74.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:52.267
It also says when nothing fits.

00:00:52.582 --> 00:00:56.412
On 23 questions with no answer, it said so on 22.

00:00:56.726 --> 00:01:00.886
Its weak spot is a need written in plain words that share no vocabulary with

00:01:00.887 --> 00:01:01.671
the item.

00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:04.411
It found 11 of 51 of those.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.707
Reuse is the next step.

00:01:07.184 --> 00:01:10.712
On Eranos we sent questions again on November 4.

00:01:10.957 --> 00:01:14.857
An exact repeat was answered from the library 5 times out of 5,

00:01:14.893 --> 00:01:16.297
with no model call.

00:01:16.611 --> 00:01:20.465
A reworded question was answered from the library 2 times in 10.

00:01:20.779 --> 00:01:24.447
Related questions that should not reuse stayed at 0 of 5.

00:01:24.761 --> 00:01:28.522
Exact repeats work well, and rewording is still weak.

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:31.439
Search first, then reuse what fits.

00:01:31.452 --> 00:01:33.343
Connect your agents today.
